-- src:865 | cơ giới đường bộ (đối với xe chở hàng căn cứ vào tải trọng, đối với xe chở người căn cứ
-- src:866 | vào số người chở trên trên xe, đối với xe vừa chở người vừa chở hàng căn cứ vào tải
-- src:867 | trọng hoặc số người chở trên xe).
@ref Article 14.1.4 (src 854-867)
GIVEN `the circumstances` IS A `The circumstances`
      `the vehicle`       IS A `A vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 14.1.4 — overloaded by more than 20% and up to 50%` `the circumstances` `the vehicle` MEANS
        `the overload, as a fraction, of` `the circumstances` `in` `the vehicle` GREATER THAN 20%
    AND `the overload, as a fraction, of` `the circumstances` `in` `the vehicle` AT MOST 50%

@ref Article 14.1 (src 803-867)
GIVEN `the circumstances` IS A `The circumstances`
      `the conduct`       IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the vehicle`       IS A `A vehicle`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reduction ground`
`Article 14.1 — the reduction grounds met by` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the vehicle` MEANS
    filter `met` (LIST `1.1(a) rescue, scene, police or Tasco not attended to`,
                       `1.1(b) no written notice within 05 days`,
                       `1.1(c) driver drowsy or asleep`,
                       `1.2(a) car moved, dismantled or repaired without consent`,
                       `1.2(b) driver left the scene or avoided testing`,
                       `1.2(c) speeding by more than 20% and up to 50%`,
                       `1.2(d) incomplete declaration or unnotified increase in risk`,
                       `1.3(a) right of recourse not preserved, or a settlement with the third party`,
                       `1.3(b) dishonest or concealed information`,
                       `1.4 overloaded by more than 20% and up to 50%`)
    WHERE
        `met` g MEANS
            CONSIDER g
            WHEN `1.1(a) rescue, scene, police or Tasco not attended to` THEN
                    `the conduct`'s `rescue or limitation measures not fully taken`
                OR  `the conduct`'s `scene not protected, without an authority's direction`
                OR  `the conduct`'s `police not notified immediately`
                OR  `the conduct`'s `Tasco not notified immediately or its instructions not followed`
            WHEN `1.1(b) no written notice within 05 days` THEN `Article 14.1.1(b) — no written notice within 05 days` `the circumstances` `the conduct`
            WHEN `1.1(c) driver drowsy or asleep` THEN `the conduct`'s `driver drowsy or asleep at the wheel`
            WHEN `1.2(a) car moved, dismantled or repaired without consent` THEN `the conduct`'s `vehicle moved, dismantled or repaired without Tasco's consent, when not necessary`
            WHEN `1.2(b) driver left the scene or avoided testing` THEN `the conduct`'s `driver left the scene or did not follow alcohol or drug testing instructions`
            WHEN `1.2(c) speeding by more than 20% and up to 50%` THEN
                    `the speed over the limit, as a fraction, in` `the circumstances` GREATER THAN 20%
                AND `the speed over the limit, as a fraction, in` `the circumstances` AT MOST 50%
            WHEN `1.2(d) incomplete declaration or unnotified increase in risk` THEN `the conduct`'s `incomplete or untruthful declaration, or an increase in risk not notified`
            WHEN `1.3(a) right of recourse not preserved, or a settlement with the third party` THEN `the conduct`'s `right of recourse not preserved or transferred, or a settlement made with the third party`
            WHEN `1.3(b) dishonest or concealed information` THEN `the conduct`'s `information given dishonestly, concealed or falsified`
            WHEN `1.4 overloaded by more than 20% and up to 50%` THEN `Article 14.1.4 — overloaded by more than 20% and up to 50%` `the circumstances` `the vehicle`

-- The rate one ground carries. A band's rate is Tasco's recorded decision; none recorded, or one
-- outside the band, and the encoding declines rather than pick a point for Tasco.
@ref Article 14.1 (src 807, 824, 842, 854)
GIVEN `the ground`          IS A `A reduction ground`
      `the determinations`  IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the overload`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 14.1 — the rate for` `the ground` `, as Tasco determined` `the determinations` `, at an overload of` `the overload` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the ground`
    WHEN `1.1(a) rescue, scene, police or Tasco not attended to` THEN 10%
    WHEN `1.1(b) no written notice within 05 days`               THEN 10%
    WHEN `1.1(c) driver drowsy or asleep`                        THEN 10%
    WHEN `1.3(a) right of recourse not preserved, or a settlement with the third party` THEN `in the 50 to 100 band`
    WHEN `1.3(b) dishonest or concealed information`                                    THEN `in the 50 to 100 band`
    WHEN `1.4 overloaded by more than 20% and up to 50%`         THEN `the overload`
    OTHERWISE                                                         `in the 20 to 50 band`
    WHERE
        `in the 20 to 50 band` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the determinations`'s `rate chosen in the 20 to 50 per cent band`
            WHEN JUST r  THEN IF r AT LEAST 20% AND r AT MOST 50% THEN r ELSE `Tasco's chosen rate lies outside the band Article 14 allows`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.2`
        `in the 50 to 100 band` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the determinations`'s `rate chosen in the 50 to 100 per cent band`
            WHEN JUST r  THEN IF r AT LEAST 50% AND r AT MOST 100% THEN r ELSE `Tasco's chosen rate lies outside the band Article 14 allows`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.3`

@ref Article 14.1.2: "từ 20% đến 50%", with no criterion for the point in the band
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.2` MEANS
    REFUSE "Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.2"

@ref Article 14.1.3: "từ 50% đến toàn bộ", with no criterion for the point in the band
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.3` MEANS
    REFUSE "Tasco has not determined a rate within the band of Article 14.1.3"

@ref Article 14.1.2 and 14.1.3: a rate outside the printed band is not one the article allows
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Tasco's chosen rate lies outside the band Article 14 allows` MEANS
    REFUSE "Tasco's chosen rate lies outside the band Article 14 allows"

