-- src:876 | bộ phận và bồi thường tồn thất toàn bộ.
-- (2.1): where several grounds are met, the single highest rate, not their sum.
-- (2.2): the reduction applies to a partial and to a total loss alike.
@ref Article 14.2.1 (src 871-873)
GIVEN `the grounds`         IS A LIST OF `A reduction ground`
      `the determinations`  IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the overload`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 14.2.1 — the highest rate among` `the grounds` `, as Tasco determined` `the determinations` `, at an overload of` `the overload` MEANS
    maximum1 0 (map (GIVEN g YIELD `Article 14.1 — the rate for` g `, as Tasco determined` `the determinations` `, at an overload of` `the overload`) `the grounds`)

§§ `Article 15 — Settlement`

§§§ `15.1.1 and 15.1.2 — a partial loss: repair, replacement, repainting`

