-- Repainting the whole car is paid only if more than half its paint area was damaged.
@ref Article 15.1.2 (src 892-893)
GIVEN `the loss` IS AN `An own-damage loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.1.2 — the repaint allowed for` `the loss` MEANS
    IF   `the loss`'s `more than half the paint area damaged`
    THEN `the loss`'s `cost of repainting the whole vehicle`
    ELSE 0

§§§ `15.1.3 — depreciation`

-- src:895 | Quy định về khấu hao
-- src:897 | a. Khấu hao chỉ áp dụng đối với bộ phận được thay thế.
-- src:899 | b. Phương thức xác định chỉ phí khấu hao được tính bằng chi phí thay thế thực tế trừ đi
-- src:900 | số tiền khấu hao.
-- src:902 | c. Số tiền khấu hao vật tư, phụ tùng (không bao gồm pin điện động cơ) như sau:
-- (a) only a replaced part is depreciated; (b) the payment for it is the actual cost of the
-- replacement less the depreciation; (c) the rate for parts other than the traction battery, by
-- the car's time in use (Article 1.11) and whether it is a business car.
--
-- THE TABLE OF 15.1.3(c), one row per printed row. Time in use in months, from (inclusive) and
-- below (exclusive); the last row has no upper edge, written as 0.
-- src:904 | Tỷ lệ khấu hao
-- src:906 | Thời gian sử dụng xe
-- src:907 | Xe không kinh doanh | Xe kinh doanh
-- src:909 | Xe sử dụng dưới 01 năm 0% 0%
-- src:910 | Xe sử dụng từ 01 năm đến dưới 03 năm 0% 10%
-- src:911 | Xe sử dụng từ 03 năm đến dưới 06 năm 15% 20%
-- src:912 | Xe sử dụng từ 06 năm đến dưới 10 năm 25% 30%
-- src:913 | Xe sử dụng từ 10 năm đến dưới 15 năm 35% 40%
-- src:914 | Xe sử dụng từ 15 năm trở lên 50% 55%
DECLARE `A depreciation row` HAS
    `from months`             IS A NUMBER
    `below months`            IS A NUMBER
    `rate, not for business`  IS A NUMBER
    `rate, for business`      IS A NUMBER

@ref Article 15.1.3(c) (src 904-914; figures checked on PDF page 17)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A depreciation row`
`Article 15.1.3(c) — the table for parts` MEANS
    --                        from  below  not business  business
    LIST
        (`A depreciation row` OF   0,    12,      0%,     0%),     -- dưới 01 năm
        (`A depreciation row` OF  12,    36,      0%,    10%),     -- từ 01 năm đến dưới 03 năm
        (`A depreciation row` OF  36,    72,     15%,    20%),     -- từ 03 năm đến dưới 06 năm
        (`A depreciation row` OF  72,   120,     25%,    30%),     -- từ 06 năm đến dưới 10 năm
        (`A depreciation row` OF 120,   180,     35%,    40%),     -- từ 10 năm đến dưới 15 năm
        (`A depreciation row` OF 180,     0,     50%,    55%)       -- từ 15 năm trở lên

-- src:927 | d. Số tiền khấu hao bộ pin điện động cơ được như sau:
-- src:929 | Tỷ lệ khấu hao
-- src:931 | Thời gian sử pin điện động cơ
-- src:932 | Xekhông kinh doanh | Xe kinh doanh
-- src:934 | Xe sử dụng dưới 01 năm 0% 10%
-- src:935 | Xe sử dụng từ 01 năm đến dưới 03 năm 30% 50%
-- src:936 | Xe sử dụng từ 03 năm đến dưới 06 năm 50% 70%
-- src:937 | Xe sử dụng từ 06 năm đến dưới 10 năm 70% 80%
-- src:938 | Xe sử dụng từ 10 năm đến dưới 15 năm 90% 90%
-- THE TABLE OF 15.1.3(d), for the traction battery. Its heading counts the BATTERY's time in use
-- ("Thời gian sử pin điện động cơ"); its rows still say "Xe sử dụng" (the car used). The heading
-- is taken (fork F-16). It stops at "dưới 15 năm": there is no row for a battery 15 years old or
-- more (finding X-11). Counted here in months like 15.1.3(c).
@ref Article 15.1.3(d) (src 927-938; figures checked on PDF page 18)
GIVETH A LIST OF `A depreciation row`
`Article 15.1.3(d) — the table for the traction battery` MEANS
    --                        from  below  not business  business
    LIST
        (`A depreciation row` OF   0,    12,      0%,    10%),
        (`A depreciation row` OF  12,    36,     30%,    50%),
        (`A depreciation row` OF  36,    72,     50%,    70%),
        (`A depreciation row` OF  72,   120,     70%,    80%),
        (`A depreciation row` OF 120,   180,     90%,    90%) 

-- Reading one row of a table.
GIVEN `the row`      IS A `A depreciation row`
      `the months`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the row` `spans` `the months` MEANS
        `the months` AT LEAST `the row`'s `from months`
    AND (   `the row`'s `below months` EQUALS 0
         OR `the months` LESS THAN `the row`'s `below months`)

GIVEN `the table`    IS A LIST OF `A depreciation row`
      `the months`   IS A NUMBER
      `for business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rate in` `the table` `for` `the months` `months of use, for business:` `for business` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r `spans` `the months`) `the table`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN IF `for business` THEN r's `rate, for business` ELSE r's `rate, not for business`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `the depreciation table of Article 15.1.3(d) has no row for a traction battery 15 years old or more`

@ref Article 15.1.3(d) (src 938): the last printed row is "từ 10 năm đến dưới 15 năm"
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the depreciation table of Article 15.1.3(d) has no row for a traction battery 15 years old or more` MEANS
    REFUSE "the depreciation table of Article 15.1.3(d) has no row for a traction battery 15 years old or more"

-- src:940 | e. Quy định khác:
-- src:942 | - Các bộ phận như săm lốp, ắc quy, lọc gió, lọc dầu, lọc xăng, gioăng phớt, má
-- src:943 | phanh, bạt thùng; các loại dung dịch như dầu động cơ, dầu phanh, đầu hộp số, dầu
-- src:944 | trợ lực lái; nước làm mát, gas điều hòa áp dụng mức khấu hao 50% giá trị bộ phận
-- src:946 | thay mới.
-- src:947 | - Các bộ phận như kính chắn gió, mặt gương chiếu hậu không áp dụng khấu hao giá
-- src:948 | trị bộ phận thay mới.
-- (e): tyres, 12 V batteries, filters, gaskets, brake pads, the goods-body canvas, oils, coolant and
-- refrigerant gas at 50%; windscreen and mirror glass not depreciated at all.
@ref Article 15.1.3 (src 895-948)
GIVEN `the months of use`        IS A NUMBER
      `for business`             IS A BOOLEAN
      `no depreciation by BS01`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `the item`                 IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.1.3 — the depreciation rate, at` `the months of use` `months of use, for business:` `for business` `, BS01:` `no depreciation by BS01` `, on` `the item` MEANS
    IF   NOT `the item`'s `replaced`
    THEN 0                                                                  -- (a)
    ELSE CONSIDER `the item`'s `kind`
         WHEN `a tyre or inner tube`            THEN 50%                    -- (e), not lifted by BS01
         WHEN `a goods-body canvas`             THEN 50%                    -- (e)
         WHEN `a part on the 50 per cent list`  THEN 50%                    -- (e)
         WHEN `windscreen or mirror glass`      THEN 0                      -- (e)
         WHEN `the traction battery`            THEN
              IF   `no depreciation by BS01`
              THEN 0
              ELSE `the rate in` `Article 15.1.3(d) — the table for the traction battery` `for` (`the item`'s `years the traction battery has been used` TIMES 12) `months of use, for business:` `for business`
         OTHERWISE
              IF   `no depreciation by BS01`
              THEN 0
              ELSE `the rate in` `Article 15.1.3(c) — the table for parts` `for` `the months of use` `months of use, for business:` `for business`

§§§ `15.1.4 — under-insurance, and the sum insured as the ceiling`

-- src:949 | Nguyên tắc xác định số tiền bồi thường
-- src:951 | a.. Trường hợp xe được bảo hiểm bằng hoặc trên giá trị, số tiền bồi thường bằng chỉ phí
-- src:952 | hợp lý để sửa chữa, thay thế bộ phận bị thiệt hại.
-- src:954 | b. Trường hợp xe được bảo hiểm dưới giá trị, số tiền bồi thường sẽ được tính theo tỷ lệ
-- src:955 | giữa số tiền bảo hiểm và giá thị trường của xe tại thời điểm tham gia bảo hiểm.
-- src:957 | c. Trong mọi trường hợp, số tiền bồi thường sẽ không vượt quá số tiền bảo hiểm ghi
-- src:958 | trên hợp đồng bảo hiểm/ GCNBH.
@ref Article 15.1.4(b) (src 954-955)
GIVEN `the policy`  IS A `A policy`
      `the section` IS AN `An own-damage section`
      `the amount`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.1.4(b) — the proportion for under-insurance under` `the policy` `the section` `of` `the amount` MEANS
    IF   `Article 12.2 — the car is insured below its market value` `the policy` `the section`
    THEN `the amount` TIMES `the section`'s `sum insured` DIVIDED BY `the policy`'s `the vehicle`'s `market value when the contract was concluded`
    ELSE `the amount`

§§§ `15.1.5 — the deductible, at least 500.000 đồng`

-- src:960 | Quy định về mức khấu trừ: Bảo hiểm Tasco áp dụng mức khấu trừ tối thiểu là 500.000
-- src:961 | đồng (chưa bao gồm VAT) vụ tổn thất.
-- At least 500.000 đồng (VND 500,000) before VAT per loss: the policy's own figure where it is
-- higher, otherwise 500.000 (fork F-17). The paragraph stands under "1. Tổn thất bộ phận", so it
-- sets the minimum for a partial loss; a total loss takes only the policy's own figure, if any
-- (fork F-18).
@ref Article 15.1.5 (src 960-961; "500.000" checked on PDF page 18)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.1.5 — the minimum deductible` MEANS 500000

@ref Article 15.1.5 (src 960-961)
GIVEN `the section` IS AN `An own-damage section`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.1.5 — the deductible for a partial loss under` `the section` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the section`'s `deductible stated on the policy`
    WHEN JUST d  THEN max d `Article 15.1.5 — the minimum deductible`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `Article 15.1.5 — the minimum deductible`

§§§ `15.2 — a total loss`

-- src:963 | Tổn thất toàn bộ
-- src:965 | Xe được ooi là tồn thất toàn bộ trong các trường hợp sau:
-- src:967 | a. Chi phí ước tính sửa chữa, thay thế thiệt hại của xe trên 75% giá thị trường của xe tại
-- src:968 | thời điểm ngay trước khi xảy ra tổn thất.
-- src:970 | b. Bị mất trộm, mất cướp toàn bộ xe đã có kết luận điều tra và/hoặc quyết định đình chỉ
-- src:971 | điều tra, đình chỉ khởi tố vụ án hình sự của cơ quan có thẩm quyền.
-- A total loss: the estimated repair is more than 75% of the market value immediately before the
-- loss; or the whole car was stolen or robbed AND the police concluded the investigation, or
-- suspended it, or declined to prosecute. A theft without that decision is not yet a total loss,
-- and the chapter says nothing else about it: the encoding declines (finding X-13).
DECLARE `The extent of an own-damage loss` IS ONE OF
    `a partial loss`
    `a total loss`

@ref Article 15.2.1 (src 965-971; "75%" checked on PDF page 18)
GIVEN `the loss` IS AN `An own-damage loss`
GIVETH AN `The extent of an own-damage loss`
`Article 15.2.1 — the extent of` `the loss` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the loss`'s `estimated cost of repair` GREATER THAN 75% TIMES `the loss`'s `market value immediately before the loss`
              THEN `a total loss`                                                     -- (a)
           IF `the loss`'s `cause` EQUALS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`
              THEN IF   `the loss`'s `investigation concluded or suspended, or prosecution declined`
                   THEN `a total loss`                                                -- (b)
                   ELSE `a theft of the whole car is not a total loss until the investigation is concluded or suspended`
           OTHERWISE `a partial loss`

@ref Article 15.2.1(b) (src 970-971)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`a theft of the whole car is not a total loss until the investigation is concluded or suspended` MEANS
    REFUSE "a theft of the whole car is not a total loss until the investigation is concluded or suspended"

-- src:975 | 2.2.. Nguyên tắc xác định số tiền bồi thường: Số tiền bồi thường tổn thất toàn bộ bằng giá thị
-- src:976 | trường của xe tại thời điểm ngay trước khi xảy ra tổn thất và không vượt quá số tiền bảo
-- src:977 | hiểm ghi trên hợp đồng bảo hiểm/ GCNBH.
-- The market value immediately before the loss, at most the sum insured. No proportion for
-- under-insurance (the proportion of 15.1.4 is in the partial-loss paragraph).
@ref Article 15.2.2 (src 975-977)
GIVEN `the section` IS AN `An own-damage section`
      `the loss`    IS AN `An own-damage loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 15.2.2 — the payment for a total loss under` `the section` `of` `the loss` MEANS
    min (`the loss`'s `market value immediately before the loss`) (`the section`'s `sum insured`)

§§ `Article 16 — Salvage after payment`

-- src:979 | Điều l6. Thu hồi tài sản sau bồi thường
-- src:980 | 1. Đối với trường hợp bồi thường tồn thất bộ phận, Bảo hiểm Tasco sẽ thu hồi bộ phận hư
-- src:981 | hỏng đã được trả tiền bồi thường (trong mọi trường hợp).
-- src:982 | 2. Đối với trường hợp bồi thường tồn thất toàn bộ, xe bị tổn thất được thu hồi và thuộc sở
-- src:983 | hữu của Bảo hiểm Tasco.
-- src:984 | 2.1... Trường hợp xe tham gia bảo hiểm dưới giá trị, Bảo hiểm Tasco thu hồi phần giá trị tương
-- src:985 | đương theo tỷ lệ tham gia bảo hiểm.
-- src:987 | 22. Trường hợp chủ xe có yêu cầu nhận lại chiếc xe bị tổn thất toàn bộ, Bảo hiểm Tasco sẽ
-- src:988 | giảm số tiền bồi thường tổn thất toàn bộ tương đương giá trị thu hồi chiếc xe bị tổn thất
-- src:989 | theo định giá của Bảo hiểm Tasco.
-- src:991 | 2.3. Trường hợp xe bị mất trộm, mất cướp sau đó tìm được xe bị mắt trộm, mất cướp thì Bảo
-- src:992 | hiểm Tasco được quyền sở hữu toàn bộ chiếc xe đó.
-- (1) Tasco keeps the damaged parts it paid for. (2) After a total loss the car becomes Tasco's;
-- (2.1) if under-insured, only the proportion insured; (2.2) if the owner keeps the car, the payment
-- is reduced by the salvage value Tasco puts on it; (2.3) a stolen car later found becomes Tasco's
-- outright, under-insured or not, against (2.1) (finding X-14).
@ref Article 16.2.1 and 16.2.3 (src 984-992)
GIVEN `the policy`  IS A `A policy`
      `the section` IS AN `An own-damage section`
      `the loss`    IS AN `An own-damage loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 16.2 — the share of the car Tasco takes after a total loss, under` `the policy` `the section` `of` `the loss` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the loss`'s `cause` EQUALS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`              THEN 100%    -- 2.3
           IF `Article 12.2 — the car is insured below its market value` `the policy` `the section`
              THEN `the section`'s `sum insured` DIVIDED BY `the policy`'s `the vehicle`'s `market value when the contract was concluded`  -- 2.1
           OTHERWISE 100%                                                                               -- 2

@ref Article 16.2.2 (src 987-989)
GIVEN `the loss`           IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the determinations` IS A `Tasco's determinations`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 16.2.2 — the salvage deducted when the owner keeps the car, in` `the loss` `, as Tasco valued it` `the determinations` MEANS
    IF   NOT `the loss`'s `the owner keeps the vehicle`
    THEN 0
    ELSE CONSIDER `the determinations`'s `salvage value of a vehicle the owner keeps`
         WHEN JUST v  THEN v
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `Tasco has not valued the salvage of the car the owner keeps`

@ref Article 16.2.2: "theo định giá của Bảo hiểm Tasco"
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Tasco has not valued the salvage of the car the owner keeps` MEANS
    REFUSE "Tasco has not valued the salvage of the car the owner keeps"

§§ `The settlement of an own-damage claim`

-- What the additional clauses of Chapter VI change in this chapter's steps. Computed in
-- tasco-ch6-additional.l4; `no additional clause` is the record for a policy with none.
DECLARE `An additional deductible` HAS
    `rate of the payment` IS A NUMBER
    `minimum`             IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `What the additional clauses change` HAS
    `general exclusions lifted`                        IS A LIST OF `A general exclusion`
    `own-damage exclusions lifted`                     IS A LIST OF `An own-damage exclusion`
    `no depreciation on parts or the traction battery` IS A BOOLEAN       -- BS01
    `no proportion for under-insurance`                IS A BOOLEAN       -- BS06
    `deductibles of the clauses engaged`               IS A LIST OF `An additional deductible`

GIVETH A `What the additional clauses change`
`no additional clause` MEANS
    `What the additional clauses change` WITH
        `general exclusions lifted`                        IS EMPTY
        `own-damage exclusions lifted`                     IS EMPTY
        `no depreciation on parts or the traction battery` IS FALSE
        `no proportion for under-insurance`                IS FALSE
        `deductibles of the clauses engaged`               IS EMPTY

-- Each step of the settlement, so that the answer can be explained step by step.
DECLARE `An own-damage settlement` HAS
    `extent`                         IS AN `The extent of an own-damage loss`
    `items allowed, after depreciation` IS A NUMBER
    `after the proportion for under-insurance` IS A NUMBER
    `costs allowed`                  IS A NUMBER
    `reduction grounds`              IS A LIST OF `A reduction ground`
    `reduction rate`                 IS A NUMBER
    `after the reduction`            IS A NUMBER
    `deductible`                     IS A NUMBER
    `after the deductible`           IS A NUMBER
    `payable`                        IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `An own-damage answer` IS ONE OF
    `own damage not covered` HAS `the reasons`    IS A LIST OF `A reason a claim is not covered`
                                 `the exclusions` IS A LIST OF `An own-damage exclusion`
    `own damage payable`     HAS `the settlement` IS AN `An own-damage settlement`

-- The items that survive Article 13 once the clauses have lifted what they lift.
@ref Article 13 (src 743-786)
GIVEN `the changes` IS A `What the additional clauses change`
      `the loss`    IS AN `An own-damage loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A damaged item`
`the items covered, given` `the changes` `, in` `the loss` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN i YIELD null (`the item exclusions left` i)) (`the loss`'s `items`)
    WHERE
        `the item exclusions left` i MEANS
            filter (GIVEN e YIELD NOT (`lifted for` i e))
                   (`Article 13 — the exclusions of an item, in` `the loss` `:` i)
        `lifted for` i e MEANS
                elem e (`the changes`'s `own-damage exclusions lifted`)
            AND (   NOT (e EQUALS `13.10 added equipment`)
                 OR `listed` i)
        `listed` i MEANS
            CONSIDER i's `sum insured listed for this added equipment`
            WHEN JUST s  THEN TRUE
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- One item's allowance: its cost less depreciation; added equipment no more than its listed sum.
@ref Article 15.1.1, 15.1.3, BS10
GIVEN `the policy`  IS A `A policy`
      `the changes` IS A `What the additional clauses change`
      `the item`    IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the allowance under` `the policy` `, given` `the changes` `, for` `the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the item`'s `sum insured listed for this added equipment`
    WHEN JUST s  THEN min `after depreciation` s
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `after depreciation`
    WHERE
        `after depreciation` MEANS
            `the item`'s `cost`
            TIMES (1 MINUS `Article 15.1.3 — the depreciation rate, at` (`Article 1.11 — the months of use of the vehicle insured by` `the policy`)
                                                                   `months of use, for business:` (`the policy`'s `the vehicle`'s `used for business`)
                                                                   `, BS01:` (`the changes`'s `no depreciation on parts or the traction battery`)
                                                                   `, on` `the item`)

-- The deductible for the loss: the chapter's, or a clause's where it is engaged and larger
-- (fork F-19).
@ref Article 1.17, 15.1.5; BS03(b), BS04(c), BS13(c)
GIVEN `the base deductible` IS A NUMBER
      `the changes`         IS A `What the additional clauses change`
      `the amount`          IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the deductible, from a base of` `the base deductible` `, given` `the changes` `, on` `the amount` MEANS
    maximum1 `the base deductible`
             (map (GIVEN d YIELD max (d's `rate of the payment` TIMES `the amount`) (d's `minimum`))
                  (`the changes`'s `deductibles of the clauses engaged`))

-- The Article 13 exclusions that take the loss out, after the clauses' lifts; and "every item
-- excluded" where items were claimed and none survives (a whole-car theft claims no items).
@ref Article 13 (src 743-786)
GIVEN `the loss`    IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the policy`  IS A `A policy`
      `the changes` IS A `What the additional clauses change`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An own-damage exclusion`
`Chapter II — the exclusions that take out` `the loss` `under` `the policy` `, given` `the changes` MEANS
    append
        (filter (GIVEN e YIELD NOT (elem e (`the changes`'s `own-damage exclusions lifted`)))
                (`Article 13 — the exclusions of the whole loss for` (`the policy`'s `the vehicle`) `and` `the loss`))
        (IF       null (`the items covered, given` `the changes` `, in` `the loss`)
              AND NOT (null (`the loss`'s `items`))
         THEN LIST `every item of the loss is excluded`
         ELSE EMPTY)

-- The settlement, once the loss is covered.
@ref Article 11 to 16
GIVEN `the policy`         IS A `A policy`
      `the section`        IS AN `An own-damage section`
      `the circumstances`  IS A `The circumstances`
      `the conduct`        IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the determinations` IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the loss`           IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the changes`        IS A `What the additional clauses change`
GIVETH AN `An own-damage settlement`
`Chapter II — the settlement under` `the policy` `the section` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss` `, given` `the changes` MEANS
    `An own-damage settlement` WITH
        `extent`                                   IS `the extent`
        `items allowed, after depreciation`        IS `step 1-2`
        `after the proportion for under-insurance` IS `step 3`
        `costs allowed`                            IS `step 4`
        `reduction grounds`                        IS `the grounds`
        `reduction rate`                           IS `step 5 rate`
        `after the reduction`                      IS `step 5`
        `deductible`                               IS `step 6 deductible`
        `after the deductible`                     IS `step 6`
        `payable`                                  IS `step 8`
    WHERE
        `the sum insured` MEANS `the section`'s `sum insured`
        `the extent` MEANS `Article 15.2.1 — the extent of` `the loss`
        `step 1-2` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the extent`
            WHEN `a partial loss` THEN
                    sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD `the allowance under` `the policy` `, given` `the changes` `, for` i)
                             (`the items covered, given` `the changes` `, in` `the loss`))
                    PLUS `Article 15.1.2 — the repaint allowed for` `the loss`
            WHEN `a total loss` THEN
                    `Article 15.2.2 — the payment for a total loss under` `the section` `of` `the loss`
                    MINUS `Article 16.2.2 — the salvage deducted when the owner keeps the car, in` `the loss` `, as Tasco valued it` `the determinations`
        `step 3` MEANS
            IF   `the extent` EQUALS `a partial loss` AND NOT (`the changes`'s `no proportion for under-insurance`)
            THEN `Article 15.1.4(b) — the proportion for under-insurance under` `the policy` `the section` `of` `step 1-2`
            ELSE `step 1-2`
        `step 4` MEANS `Article 11.2 — the costs allowed, on a sum insured of` `the sum insured` `, for` `the loss`
        `the grounds` MEANS `Article 14.1 — the reduction grounds met by` `the circumstances` `the conduct` (`the policy`'s `the vehicle`)
        `step 5 rate` MEANS
            `Article 14.2.1 — the highest rate among` `the grounds` `, as Tasco determined` `the determinations`
                `, at an overload of` (`the overload, as a fraction, of` `the circumstances` `in` (`the policy`'s `the vehicle`))
        `step 5` MEANS (`step 3` PLUS `step 4`) TIMES (1 MINUS `step 5 rate`)
        `the base deductible` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the extent`
            WHEN `a partial loss` THEN `Article 15.1.5 — the deductible for a partial loss under` `the section`
            WHEN `a total loss`   THEN fromMaybe 0 (`the section`'s `deductible stated on the policy`)
        `step 6 deductible` MEANS `the deductible, from a base of` `the base deductible` `, given` `the changes` `, on` `step 5`
        `step 6` MEANS `Article 1.17.2 — the amount after a deductible of` `step 6 deductible` `on` `step 5`
        `step 7` MEANS `Article 11.3 — at most the sum insured of` `the sum insured` `:` `step 6`
        `step 8` MEANS
            IF   `Article 8 — the contracts are double insurance`
                    (`the sum insured` PLUS `the loss`'s `sums insured by other contracts on the same vehicle`)
                    (`the policy`'s `the vehicle`'s `market value when the contract was concluded`)
            THEN `Article 8.1 — Tasco's share of` `step 7` `on a sum insured of` `the sum insured`
                    `out of` (`the sum insured` PLUS `the loss`'s `sums insured by other contracts on the same vehicle`)
            ELSE `step 7`

-- The answer for an own-damage claim: why it is not covered, or what is payable.
@ref Decision 168/2024 Article 2; Rules Articles 2, 10 to 16
GIVEN `the policy`         IS A `A policy`
      `the circumstances`  IS A `The circumstances`
      `the conduct`        IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the determinations` IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the loss`           IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the changes`        IS A `What the additional clauses change`
GIVETH AN `An own-damage answer`
`Chapter II — the own-damage answer under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss` `, given` `the changes` MEANS
    `under these rules,` `the policy` `the answer is`
        (CONSIDER `the policy`'s `own damage`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `own damage not covered` (`the reasons` FALSE) `the exclusions`
         WHEN JUST s  THEN
              IF   null (`the reasons` TRUE) AND null `the exclusions`
              THEN `once` ((`the settlement` s)'s `payable`) `is computed,` (`own damage payable` (`the settlement` s))
              ELSE `own damage not covered` (`the reasons` TRUE) `the exclusions`)
    WHERE
        `the reasons` on MEANS
            `the shared reasons a claim under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `is not covered, the cover on the policy:` on
                `, lifting` (`the changes`'s `general exclusions lifted`)
        `the exclusions` MEANS `Chapter II — the exclusions that take out` `the loss` `under` `the policy` `, given` `the changes`
        `the settlement` s MEANS `Chapter II — the settlement under` `the policy` s `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss` `, given` `the changes`
